## Attack 7 — double filtering changing results
recurringForProjection (mcpsvc/ledger/accounts.go) receives txns already
filtered once at the call site (ts.Active().Transactions), then filters again
internally (models.NewTransactionSet(txns).Active()). Read Active()'s
implementation (models/transaction.go:466): a simple in-order append-filter
on Suppressed, idempotent and order-preserving. Applying it twice to an
already-Suppressed-free set is a no-op; confirmed no ordering or result
change. Pre-existing from attempt 1, flagged as harmless redundancy in my own
R3.1 verdict, not a regression.

